OL,3,AMore than 1,300 arrested as clashes
OL,4,Afollow another day of mass protests
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 1,300 arrests were made as
OL,8,Fhundreds of thousands of people took
OL,9,Fpart in another day of protests across
OL,10,FFrance on Saturday that were followed
OL,11,Fby some clashes later in the day,
OL,12,Fofficials have said.
OL,14,FAfter largely peaceful demonstrations,
OL,15,Fpolice fired tear gas and water cannon
OL,16,Fto disperse protesters in a number of
OL,17,Fcities including Paris, while
OL,18,Fbarricades were set alight in Marseille
OL,19,Fand people ripped boards from a shop in
OL,20,FBordeaux.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
