OL,3,AMore than 1,300 arrested as clashes
OL,4,Afollow another day of mass protests
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials have so far managed to avoid
OL,8,Frioting and looting on the scale seen
OL,9,Flast weekend, which resulted in some of
OL,10,Fthe worst scenes of disorder in
OL,11,FFrance's modern history.
OL,13,FThe interior ministry said an estimated
OL,14,F410,000 people protested on Saturday,
OL,15,Fwhile the unions put the number at
OL,16,Fabout 800,000.
